<title>UK: Manitoba sets C$125 million 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Manitoba sets C$125 million 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CIBC Wood Gundy.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MANITOBA, PROVINCE OF</p>
<p> AMT	  C$125 MLN COUPON     7.00	MATURITY    21.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.45    PAY DATE    21.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.80     SPREAD	+16 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/CA</p>
